            "review_title": "Review at Quan An UT HUONG",
            "review_text": "Myl\n4 contributions\n0\nThe restaurant is very bad in terms of service and food. Staff yelling at customers.\nSep 2026 • Family\nThe attitude of the female service staff wearing black masks on the afternoon of September 5th was very bad (could be said to be rude). While taking customer orders, I snapped at the customer. While we were waiting for food, they spoke in a rude and tasteless manner like beggars at the restaurant. Service was very slow, taking orders for three people for noodles and rice but not remembering, so they kept snapping at the customers continuously, the attitude was very rude and uneducated. The fried rice with salty fish was extremely salty, and it was even coated with salt on the salty fish, so I left the entire plate. Overall, from the service to the food, it's terrible. No one is encouraged to eat here.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten September 5, 2026",
